Specifications
--------------

IEC 60870-5-104, IEC 60870-5-101 (with their amendments), IEC 60870-5-1,
-2, -4 and -5, IEC TS 60870-5-7, IEC 62351-3, IEC 62351-5 and IEC 62351-8
are licensed IEC publications; none is redistributed. Type and cause
numbers, field layouts, bit positions, timer defaults and ranges, state
transitions and procedures are facts, written in our own words with
clause, table and figure references. No text of the standards is
reproduced. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the IEC.

