Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds lib60870-C v2.4.1
(https://github.com/mz-automation/lib60870, Copyright MZ Automation GmbH,
GPLv3 or a commercial licence) with mbedtls 3.6.6 (Apache-2.0 or
GPL-2.0-or-later) in a Docker container from their sources, together
with a peer program of ours (interop/peer/peer.c, Apache-2.0) and
lib60870's own example programs. lib60870 is used only as a test peer:
no lib60870 or mbedtls source is included in this repository, nothing of
it is linked into this module, and the container image is built on the
tester's machine and not distributed.

Test data
---------

The tests use the octet layouts and worked sequences of the IEC standards
named in each test, and published RFC vectors: RFC 3394 (AES key wrap),
RFC 4231 (HMAC-SHA-256), RFC 5869 (HKDF), RFC 7693 (BLAKE2s), RFC 7748
(X25519, X448) and RFC 7027 (brainpool curve parameters). Every key,
certificate, address and point value in the tests and the examples is a
made-up demo value; none belongs to a real installation.
